Description: Configure Ollama
 To start using Ollama, start the Ollama service:
 .
 systemctl start ollama
 .
 If you would like to enable this service permanently so that it starts
 automatically with the operating system:
 .
 systemctl enable ollama --now
Description-zh_CN.UTF-8: 配置 Ollama
 初次使用 Ollama 前，请启动 Ollama 系统服务：
 .
 systemctl start ollama
 .
 如果您希望该服务后续随系统自动启动（即启用服务），请输入：
 .
 systemctl enable ollama --now
